      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hháe, kuungá' kilá' a xuá' adór hardahamuurén kudá' tar tawoorooká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' a xuá' adór atén tira slahh'eemiís nee tira niqimís baraá yaamaá Filipír wa ale qoomár niwa hardahaaniiká ayaahúng i alé. Ala Mungú tiri /uurií haniís, Ya/abtór hho' ngari kuungá' i alki/iitaán, tam dukuutsér yaariir aga slaaslawaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma atén Ya/abtór hho' a alki/iitaanaaká as tawa dakuusaán, slám a alki/iitanaaká as inslawoó tlákw, laqaá as hee kuwa al/aymár wa sla'aan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Munguúdá' muneerén ga xuú', inós Ya/abtór hho' ngina atén i saayín. Atén Ya/abtoorí an alki/iitaán ar adoodá' inós i slai. Atén heé ta sla'atimisaan i kaahh, ala heé ta sla'atimisaan a Mungú kudaádá' muneerén ga xuú'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma kuungá' a xuá' adór atén axweesanoó muu gu sla'atimís ngura baloó dirhúngií axweesaniiká. Nee slám aga axweesaniiká as slaasláw kawa slawaan. Mungú a lamabu'usmoorén. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atén aga sla'aaniiká muu tiwa xirfayeemisi, tam kuungá', laqaá tam múk hatlae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala geeraawo a gár hariim atén ar yaariir kawa dirhúngií sla'aan as atén tawa ya/abuusér Kristo. Ala qoomár atén tawa tla/angwhúng i diriiaan, atén a múk tsatsaa'arén dirhunge, adoodár aayo na/iiwós ngir amohhe'eemaamis ar tsatsaa'areema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atén kuungá' nuna ló'wa sla'aán. Gawaá adoorihe Ya/abtór hho' ngina haniisár wa sla'aán dirhúng i alé. Ala a har tí kiloseeká, ala tam ataá kilá' tina haniisár wa sla'aán sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hháe, án ngi slaá' kuungá' a insleerá' adór atén gadiyeé kara tleehhaán ar ilakaahara. Asma qoomár atén Ya/abtór hho' kawa alki/iitaán dirhúng i ale, atén an gadiyuumaamisaán tlaatla/aangw nee xweeraawo, as umuúqo heewo dirhunge muwa diitsakwaár ar awaán.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' a lamabu'uuseerén, tam Mungú sleeme, adór atén tara tla/ángw kuungaásingaá haratlintaauusér wa hootaán ar slafíngw hhohhó' nee oo ganaá', nee slám aga dakuusaniiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' a xuá' adór atén umuúqo heewo dirhunge ngura amohhe'eemaamiisaán, adoodár baabá na/iiwós ngir amohhe'eemaamisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuna gurkwa/amisaán nee nuri naanaaqaán, nuri harhhehhe'eemisaán as tawa hota' ar slafíngw hariím dír Munguhe, kudá' kuungá' naa ateet tawa data' baraá waawuti'iimaarós tidá' xirfuú koom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gár hatlá' ar Mungú kuwa sluufmiisaan daqisleém a tí. Qoomár atén Ya/abtór Mungú ngiwa dirhúng i alki/iitaán, kuungá' Ya/abtoodá' kari iiárií qasé', nee kari ilaoté'. Kawa ilaoté' a adór Ya/abtór heewooká ala ar Mungú. Ala ar ló' a ar Mungú. Nee inós an kudá' gadiyér tleéhh baraahúng wa aleeró, kuungaásingá' aga haratlintie'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' hhaee'eé', gár kuungá' taa sleeré' a adór tidár múk kríshaanáy oo baraá yaamaá Yudeár i dirií' aa sláy, mukdá' Yesu Kristo gwa haratlintii'. Kuungá' slahh'eemisuú taa sleeré' dír xoororhúng ar kilá' wa ale, an adór slahh'eemisuú inooín taa sláy dír múk Yahudír wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Yahudi an kudá' Aako Yesu gwa gaas, nee aaruusero, nee atén sleeme tiri slahh'eemisiyé'. Inooín sla'aarír Mungú kaa leelehhiitiiká. Slám a wakuusér muu sleémeero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma inooín atén tin ila/aná' as Ya/abtór hho' mawa alki/iitaán dír múk xoorduwo, as matawa ba/án. Gawaá adoorihe inooín harqoomayduú tlakweemaaín kun hatsmiis. Ala hám daxta sakwasleemár Mungú gaa i hardát.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hháe, atén nee kuungá' tina paraatlaán har qoomár niinawe, ala ar slaqwa kilós, ala ar baraá muneerooká. Qoomaadae ana sla'aán nee ana ilatleeruusaán kángw kilá' wa aleeró tiwa araan nee kuungá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe ana sla'aán niwa daqawan. Anuú Paulo har geeraawo daqeemu una iiár, ay sagaáwa tsár sleeme. Ala Neetlaangw loohirén gari kaangaár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' ka xua' haraxu'utirén nee qwal/uurén nee slamángw xirfuurén dír geeraá Aakoorén Yesuwo qoomár inós binda hardáh, a milá ahaá, a kuungaáeéke? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eeít, kuungá' an xirfuurén nee qwal/uurén.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
